WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
Hi, I'm Juan Villa, a software developer.

2
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.494
I build software the way I like to play video games:

3
00:00:07.494 --> 00:00:09.190
going for the platinum.

4
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.665
Since 2022 I've worked remotely for companies in

5
00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:14.140
Mexico, and with clients in Spain and Argentina.

6
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.390
I started out studying electronic engineering,

7
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.592
then computer science at a technical college,

8
00:00:18.592 --> 00:00:20.940
but what taught me the most was building things.

9
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.813
On this site you'll see apps made by me, for me,

10
00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:29.008
that are in the app stores too; my work; my startup,

11
00:00:29.008 --> 00:00:31.186
which right now is Salvalo;

12
00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:35.220
and the startup and developer events I've been to.

13
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.422
The site is in Spanish, English and Chinese

14
00:00:37.422 --> 00:00:39.316
— you can switch it at the top right.

15
00:00:39.316 --> 00:00:41.516
The whole page is narrated,

16
00:00:41.516 --> 00:00:44.776
and subtitles appear as the audio plays,

17
00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:47.221
so to read it you listen to it

18
00:00:47.221 --> 00:00:51.296
— but you can turn the volume down, and that's it.

19
00:00:51.296 --> 00:00:54.246
And yes, this is my real voice, not AI.

20
00:00:54.246 --> 00:00:56.246
Welcome.
